title: "PFAS Source-Decoupling: national-scale analysis of UCMR5 drinking-water data"
abstract: "Code testing whether U.S. drinking-water PFAS detection tracks local point-source proximity, using EPA UCMR5, facility-grade geocoding, and spatially validated gradient-boosted models."
